    "content": "  Human cell surface interactomes of brain-enhanced AAVs - CLOVER Center                                  \n\n[skip to main content](#content)\n\n[![Caltech](/static/core/img/caltech-new-logo.png)](https://www.caltech.edu)\n\n[CLOVER Center CLARITY, Optogenetics, & Vector Engineering](/)\n\n-   [AAV Repository](/aav-repository)\n    \n-   [ASPIRE Program](/aspire-program)\n    \n-   [Obtaining Reagents](/reagents)\n    \n-   [People](/People)\n    \n-   [Publications](/Publications)\n    \n-   [Contact](/Contact)\n    \n-   ![](/static/wagtail_menu/img/icon-search.png)\n    \n    SearchSearch\n    \n\nMenu ![](/static/wagtail_menu/img/menu-burger.png) \n\nClose\n\n-   [AAV Repository](/aav-repository)\n-   [ASPIRE Program](/aspire-program)\n-   [Obtaining Reagents](/reagents)\n-   [People](/People)\n-   [Publications](/Publications)\n-   [Contact](/Contact)\n\n![](/static/wagtail_menu/img/icon-search.png)\n\nSearchSearch\n\n[Home](/)  /  [News](/news)  /  Human cell surface interactomes of brain-enhanced AAVs\n\n![wynju](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2024-09-09_at_2..3168bc4e.fill-1600x810-c100.jpg)\n\n# Human cell surface interactomes of brain-enhanced AAVs\n\nSeptember 09, 2024\n\nCLOVER Director Tim Shay, affiliated Postdoctoral Fellow Seongmin Jang, graduate student Tyler Brittain, and former CLOVER Research Scientist Xinhong Chen led a team effort, including [Charles River Laboratory](https://www.criver.com/products-services/discovery-services/screening-and-profiling-assays/retrogenix-cell-microarray-technology?region=3701), to identify and characterize the cell surface and extracellular interactions of AAV9 and non-human primate (NHP) brain-enhanced AAV variants. **Among other findings, this work identifies a naturally-evolved interaction between AAV9 and the cytokine IL3, as well as interaction of engineered variants AAV9-X1.1 and CAP-Mac with LRP6 at the blood-brain barrier.** Additional co-authors include CLOVER Research Associate Yaping Lei, former CLOVER Research Scientist Xiaozhe Ding, former CLOVER Research Technicians Damien Wolfe and Erin Sullivan, and members of the Beckman Institute [Proteome Exploration Lab](https://pel.caltech.edu/).\n\n#### Catch the [full story in Nature Communications](https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-52149-0). Congrats to the team!\n\n ![bge66](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2024-09-09_at_2.16.15_PM.c804ec7d.width-450.png)Cryo-Electron Tomography map of IL3 interaction with AAV9, with interacting capsid variable regions identified via SPR noted.\n\nImage Lightbox\n\n![bge66](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2024-09-09_at_2.16.15_.c804ec7d.max-1400x800.png)\n\nCryo-Electron Tomography map of IL3 interaction with AAV9, with interacting capsid variable regions identified via SPR noted.\n\n[Download Full Image](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2024-09-09_at_2.16.15_PM.c804ec7d.original.png?download=true)\n\n![](/static/theme-v7.0/img/flame.png)\n\n![Caltech](/static/core/img/caltech-new-logo.png)\n\nCalifornia Institute of Technology\n\n![](/static/theme-v7.0/img/icon-footerpin.png)\n\n1200 East California Boulevard\n\nPasadena, California 91125\n\n[Digital Accessibility](https://digitalaccessibility.caltech.edu/) | [Privacy Notice](https://www.caltech.edu/privacy-notice) | Site Content Copyright © 2026 | [Log In](https://clover.caltech.edu/admin/login/)"
